#: src/renderer/src/components/help/UserManual.tsx
msgid "Add a <0>channel</0> for every entry of the device's channel list you want to control. Its <1>offset</1> is its number in the manual minus 1: channel 1 has offset 0, channel 2 offset 1."
msgstr "Add a <0>channel</0> for every entry of the device's channel list you want to control. Its <1>offset</1> is its number in the manual minus 1: channel 1 has offset 0, channel 2 offset 1."

#: src/renderer/src/components/fixtures/FixtureHelp.tsx
msgid "Add a <0>channel</0> for every entry of the list you want to control, named as you like. Its <1>offset</1> is its number in the manual minus 1: channel 1 has offset 0, channel 2 offset 1, and so on. Leave out the ones you don't need, the gaps are fine."
msgstr "Add a <0>channel</0> for every entry of the list you want to control, named as you like. Its <1>offset</1> is its number in the manual minus 1: channel 1 has offset 0, channel 2 offset 1, and so on. Leave out the ones you don't need, the gaps are fine."

